ok new writes salam.toml with a salam version
ok add pins the asked version
ok lock records commit and sum
ok a program imports the package
ok update stays on major 1
ok update says a new major is out
ok a dependency's dependency is locked
ok the transitive import works
ok update @latest crosses the major
ok the new major builds
ok deps downloads into an empty cache
ok deps notices a changed download
ok add refuses a package that needs a newer Salam
ok remove takes the package out
