ok uninstall lists installed programs
ok uninstall removes the program
ok search reads the registry
ok add records a version range
ok the lock takes the newest release in the range
ok a /v2 path picks major 2
ok major 1 and major 2 build side by side
ok a moved tag does not match the first download
ok a sum that differs from the published one is refused
ok deps sums prints the lines to publish
ok deps clean empties the cache
ok a prebuilt native library is downloaded and linked
ok a standard library package imports without salam add
